  "body": "Expose `WaterjetProfile`, `ToolKind::Waterjet`, `Kind::Waterjet`, and waterjet posts across the headless MCP server and agent documentation.\n\nDepends on #1881, #1882, #1883, and #1885.\n\n## Scope\n\n- **MCP schemas and handlers (`crates/app/src/mcp/`):**\n  - Support `Waterjet` tool creation and editing plus `WaterjetProfile` parameters (`kerf`, side, leads, tabs, corner slowdown, pierce and abrasive dwell, cut-data row) in `add_tool`, `edit_tool`, `add_operation`, `edit_operation`, and `get_job`.\n  - Update `s_post` schema text in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` to name shipped waterjet posts.\n  - Include waterjet 2D verification findings and post-gate blocks in `verify` output.\n- **Skill docs and integration test:**\n  - Add a Waterjet workflow guide to `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n  - Add `crates/app/tests/mcp_waterjet.rs` covering `load_machine`, `add_tool`, `add_operation`, `edit_operation`, `generate`, `verify`, `undo`/`redo`, and `post`.\n\n**Done means:** `crates/app/tests/mcp_waterjet.rs` passes the full headless waterjet workflow, and `s_post` plus `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` document `WaterjetProfile`, `Waterjet` tools, and waterjet posts accurately.\n\nPart of #1525\n",
